    "text": "<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0053_e4fca8217cb7.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 194px;\" /><br /><br />An element is assumed at distance <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> from center whose width is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>. No. of turns in width <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> No. of turns is width <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced